                <custos xml:id="m-fe1cabf1-5531-4169-bc06-dcc3e42a27f0" facs="#m-286e933d-db22-48d2-a344-b3c0b7b78477" pname="d" oct="3" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-8620a5a7-9f63-43ad-99fe-af63ccd0af76">
              <lg xml:id="m-c6d1efd5-18b5-40b3-9741-e2ff2cf7edb4">
                <l xml:id="m-50e8a0fc-ab9d-4064-85b7-86f32b6824ae" facs="#m-0d48f958-2a16-4300-b280-c87087da0f7a" label="text-like">The Solemn evening Mass</l><l xml:id="m-ef8e3b00-8c0e-43ce-b642-a3c4a28082b4" facs="#m-22bbd4b1-0f46-4f5c-920e-128a0a343b87" label="ambiguous">670</l><l xml:id="m-8bf7c5be-f7a0-4bc7-8e26-738abdda7d07" facs="#m-d2a4f1a7-9990-46f7-a473-8984001a997a" label="lyrics-like">NImili modo postquam cenátum est, accípiens et hunc praeclárum</l><l xml:id="m-acf3e4b2-7349-4514-bf19-a31dcbd0551b" facs="#m-f3f3033b-7a0a-4dfd-b454-700ec4952e8b" label="lyrics-like">D Cálicem in sanctas ac venerábiles manus suas, item tibi grátias</l><l xml:id="m-b71f98ac-35fd-4f49-9c35-610f6707667c" facs="#m-80693ef5-009d-48d9-82b3-0f5d6c496f29" label="ambiguous">agens, bene dxit, deditque discipulis suis, dicens: Accipite,</l><l xml:id="m-f7af05b6-6402-4a62-8aeb-bafd1efac59b" facs="#m-a3aab55a-4c0b-4bc1-adae-9ddf938ee4b8" label="ambiguous">et bibite ex eo omnes.</l><l xml:id="m-652f48d3-b401-4197-bf59-9d6846e6bb5e" facs="#m-90b621c6-1b37-4c91-889d-e22695ea4bc6" label="lyrics-like">Hic est enim Calix Sánguinis mei,</l><l xml:id="m-53dc7e69-9575-4ae4-910d-d391b319016f" facs="#m-9873eae8-69a2-4960-bc9b-f53fb5f8b459" label="lyrics-like">novi et aetérni testaménti:</l><l xml:id="m-8c476ef5-e30e-4498-9112-32718c50291b" facs="#m-ecac76e0-b66a-4386-961c-511bc95de410" label="lyrics-like">mystérium fidei:</l><l xml:id="m-7b4b6cc0-86dd-43f5-aebc-51fc0416fa6d" facs="#m-4786b2a4-3b87-4d36-b8b2-b86f4eeb53d3" label="ambiguous">qui pro vobis</l><l xml:id="m-4da783f8-a237-48ef-a79e-378dcb2f4cda" facs="#m-69d91333-f80f-4c1b-accd-ad1e52079119" label="lyrics-like">et pro multis effundétur</l><l xml:id="m-e2bc7a71-763f-4b90-a24b-cd491a90b304" facs="#m-3980dec7-6ffb-40a1-868d-143b685c8766" label="lyrics-like">in remissionem peccatórum.</l><l xml:id="m-874dfd95-b699-41aa-a43e-b0c439d3d7fb" facs="#m-02f30247-df5e-4507-9b07-e0f0b5b97c9a" label="lyrics-like">Haec quotiescúmque fecéritis, in mei memóriam faciétis.</l><l xml:id="m-1cfb4429-92a5-48be-8e80-9f4be7f760fa" facs="#m-6e887220-6eb8-4b40-ab03-2831b74b37de" label="text-like">And so on as at the Canon of the Mass, 17.</l><l xml:id="m-d147dec7-5c5d-4c6f-b500-bea6e670257d" facs="#m-64f5b482-7f15-4206-95e6-1100eb047a9d" label="lyrics-like">28. At the Agnus Dei, the response each time is: miserére nobis.</l><l xml:id="m-1ddf4781-9938-4673-80d9-9cf9f88f4a81" facs="#m-d82a9844-dc4c-4987-bac9-dce2999d921b" label="text-like">The hiss of peace is omitted to-day, as wvell as the first of the three pravers:</l><l xml:id="m-c9df41ed-bf2d-48b2-af14-3e465687b626" facs="#m-0ee13a59-bef9-4056-8f59-5b6100c8ee75" label="lyrics-like">Dómine Jesu Christe, qui dixisti. The Confiteor and absolution also are</l><l xml:id="m-563a706e-eca9-468e-b71e-63e5fb55b938" facs="#m-4a597ca2-6ee4-4199-814e-cc8d36305ea9" label="ambiguous">omitted.</l><l xml:id="m-1e8282ae-f3d2-46f3-b605-5f02ef8a1e69" facs="#m-bb169957-200d-49d8-b09d-e2ea65a78ed4" label="text-like">29. After receiving the Precious Blood, the celebrant savs Ecce Agnus</l><l xml:id="m-646058a5-8d53-482d-97d7-c00823147659" facs="#m-5ee6fbf0-ecca-4198-ae7b-df2fd69ded04" label="lyrics-like">Dei and three times Dómine, non sum dignus; then he gives Holy Commumion</l><l xml:id="m-004e2d47-8547-4983-b1f2-37f3e93ebfca" facs="#m-a263c16f-b861-4089-9950-3b145554c1f5" label="text-like">in the usual way.</l><l xml:id="m-ee8acdc7-02ce-4208-8c89-9885d38279f6" facs="#m-7fe8423b-9b9c-4933-ad6f-981784b870a2" label="text-like">The sacred ministers receive first, then the priests, deacons, and other clerics</l><l xml:id="m-70ae4286-329f-4cf8-91bf-d32ba06ed2c3" facs="#m-39ded81c-6205-4361-9f88-32723bf32697" label="text-like">in order; then the servers.</l><l xml:id="m-55f2e501-9c47-4cc1-ab70-6a6e72cdd4a1" facs="#m-50c2c5f0-fa49-44a0-92f9-2c0d394b8092" label="text-like">All come to the foot of the altar, two or four at a time; and, havins</l><l xml:id="m-c4dee98a-9c69-4eb6-a224-dc97e78c3a9a" facs="#m-b4518a06-754f-499c-844c-4e6b5636e5f2" label="text-like">genuflected, go to tie top step, and lneelins, receive Christ's Body with all</l><l xml:id="m-e24f2a2d-4f22-45e4-aa44-e8a0feae4da7" facs="#m-6a2b81b4-4ed2-4375-8618-8acb844f50dd" label="text-like">reverence; then they return to their place in the same order.</l><l xml:id="m-8d41c006-4c03-405c-990c-d73ad4ddd1bc" facs="#m-7164b28c-8088-4422-9cda-d1eb8b2def68" label="text-like">The faithful receive at the communion-rail.</l><l xml:id="m-6d7a9549-8f72-4567-944b-511b6adf829d" facs="#m-54498505-7459-4f37-af2e-9fe6c504b333" label="text-like">But if the number of communicants is great, other priests in surplice and</l><l xml:id="m-6361d4a5-b9fb-41b2-8ae8-5fc2948ba493" facs="#m-4f454e29-8dc4-4f3d-bc7b-009696414442" label="text-like">uhite stole may distribute Communion, either voith the celebrant at the rail</l><l xml:id="m-48f5e831-e286-41c9-a340-15f57ee75273" facs="#m-0abcf02c-71ef-4b64-8ca9-cf1235eee17b" label="text-like">or in some other suitable place; taking care, however, that the good order</l><l xml:id="m-ac403837-674c-4343-afa9-b5e12bb56e71" facs="#m-0451beb9-763b-4efe-8368-603580c81ddb" label="text-like">and devotion of the faithful is not disturbed.</l><l xml:id="m-c756936b-8790-441a-830c-8665317c3581" facs="#m-2ca6ebea-a16f-4072-a58d-6e25ea1886b2" label="text-like">I a bishop distributes Holy Communion, the faithful do not hiss his rins</l><l xml:id="m-2591b4a6-57eb-4dcb-865b-02d90a1396c0" facs="#m-94b44c15-1dd9-4690-a56e-4bc7705aa4eb" label="ambiguous">before receivine It.</l><l xml:id="m-f307f2c0-92ad-4918-9db4-8a87341c6194" facs="#m-fd60f5f8-d07d-4354-a67d-ca6eb02f48b6" label="text-like">30. The Communion antiphon can be sung by the schola while the celebrant</l><l xml:id="m-44bb3d65-95e6-40a2-a656-5ee2fb0ee049" facs="#m-0e8aef9e-2915-401e-93e2-cc6de2a3891d" label="text-like">distributes the sacred hosts.</l><l xml:id="m-39955649-affe-4d8e-af47-de22456810f2" facs="#m-76a190f0-2a0b-45a1-81dc-1a7d8b4215de" label="text-like">COMMUNION ANTIPHON</l><l xml:id="m-dac477c4-7ada-4772-be6c-2ad6a4a20e3e" facs="#m-e615dcfb-4a9b-4743-9bb2-1e08d5528933" label="ambiguous">2</l><l xml:id="m-69b683f3-948b-45d5-ba17-b2519264e500" facs="#m-f2be98dc-093d-4c83-b117-b0fa87962644" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-31b18618-8348-4906-855b-667c3b980895" facs="#m-006350e8-eb19-4dff-be91-5b32cd82be8c" label="lyrics-like">Omi- nus Jé-sus,</l><l xml:id="m-62e9c0c7-44b1-4c01-a49f-794cd2129abc" facs="#m-afa0e0e8-e378-4b11-b6bd-2debdef33cf3" label="lyrics-like">postquam cená¬ vit</l><l xml:id="m-00ee2e86-31e4-4a92-808d-4bcc6e2d2ae0" facs="#m-6955d0e8-07b3-46e9-8e50-f32d512c450d" label="ambiguous">cum</l><l xml:id="m-52ba5f02-6120-4d89-ad12-141b47058059" facs="#m-d7b7a5db-5ef1-4230-a2b7-b0ff498c378e" label="lyrics-like">lávit pédes e-órum, et á-it il-lis</l><l xml:id="m-d01c1838-448f-4952-9eb7-8532631cf495" facs="#m-87f4e4d5-c690-4a66-91d1-2a35647985e3" label="lyrics-like">discípu-lis sú-is,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>